{"config":{"lang":["en"],"separator":"[\\s\\-]+","pipeline":["stopWordFilter"],"fields":{"title":{"boost":1000.0},"text":{"boost":1.0},"tags":{"boost":1000000.0}}},"docs":[{"location":"","title":"Home","text":""},{"location":"#welcome-to-my-personal-docs","title":"Welcome to My Personal Docs","text":""},{"location":"Computer%20Vision/Color/","title":"Color","text":""},{"location":"Computer%20Vision/Color/#bgr-to-rgb","title":"BGR to RGB","text":"<pre><code>rgb = cv.cvtColor(img, cv.COLOR_BGR2RGB)\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"Computer%20Vision/Color/#rgb-to-grayscale","title":"RGB to Grayscale","text":"<pre><code>gray = cv.cvtColor(img, cv.COLOR_RGB2GRAY)\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"Computer%20Vision/Color/#grayscale-to-binary","title":"Grayscale to Binary","text":"<pre><code>_, binary = cv.threshold(gray, 127, 255, cv.THRESH_BINARY)\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"Computer%20Vision/Images/","title":"Images","text":""},{"location":"Computer%20Vision/Images/#read-image","title":"Read Image","text":"<pre><code>img = cv.imread(\"cat.jpg\")\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"Computer%20Vision/Images/#show-image","title":"Show Image","text":"<p>Membuat user define function <code>showImage()</code> </p> <pre><code>def showImage(img, width=5, height=5):\n    if img is None:\n        print(\"Gambar tidak ditemukan.\")\n    else:\n        img_rgb = cv.cvtColor(img, cv.COLOR_BGR2RGB)\n\n        plt.figure(figsize=(width, height))\n        plt.imshow(img_rgb)\n        plt.axis(\"off\")\n        plt.show()\n</code></pre> <p>Memanggil function <code>showImage()</code> untuk menampilkan gambar</p> <pre><code>showImage(img)\n</code></pre> <p></p>"},{"location":"Machine%20Learning/Data%20Cleaning/","title":"Data Cleaning","text":""},{"location":"Machine%20Learning/Data%20Cleaning/#remove-empty-cells","title":"Remove Empty Cells","text":"<pre><code>df = df.dropna()\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"Machine%20Learning/Data%20Cleaning/#remove-duplicates","title":"Remove Duplicates","text":"<pre><code>df = df.drop_duplicates()\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"Machine%20Learning/Data%20Info/","title":"Data Info","text":""},{"location":"Machine%20Learning/Data%20Info/#data-info","title":"Data Info","text":"<pre><code>df.info()\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"Machine%20Learning/Data%20Info/#head","title":"Head","text":"<pre><code>df.head()\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"Machine%20Learning/Data%20Info/#tail","title":"Tail","text":"<pre><code>df.tail()\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"Machine%20Learning/Load%20File/","title":"Load File","text":""},{"location":"Machine%20Learning/Load%20File/#load-csv","title":"Load CSV","text":"<pre><code>df = pd.read_csv(\"data.csv\")\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"Machine%20Learning/Load%20File/#load-json","title":"Load JSON","text":"<pre><code>df = pd.read_json(\"data.json\")\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"Machine%20Learning/Mean%2C%20Median%20%26%20Mode/","title":"Mean, Median & Mode","text":""},{"location":"Machine%20Learning/Mean%2C%20Median%20%26%20Mode/#mean","title":"Mean","text":""},{"location":"Machine%20Learning/Mean%2C%20Median%20%26%20Mode/#median","title":"Median","text":""},{"location":"Machine%20Learning/Mean%2C%20Median%20%26%20Mode/#mode","title":"Mode","text":""},{"location":"Machine%20Learning/Rename%20Column/","title":"Rename Column","text":""},{"location":"Machine%20Learning/Rename%20Column/#rename-column","title":"Rename Column","text":"<pre><code>df = df.rename(columns={\n    \"A\": \"col_a\",\n    \"B\": \"col_b\"\n})\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"Machine%20Learning/Rename%20Column/#add-column","title":"Add Column","text":"<pre><code>df[\"new_col\"] = np.nan\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"Machine%20Learning/Rename%20Column/#drop-column","title":"Drop Column","text":"<pre><code>df = df.drop(\"A\", axis=1)\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"Machine%20Learning/Sorting%20Data/","title":"Sorting Data","text":""},{"location":"Machine%20Learning/Sorting%20Data/#by-column-ascending","title":"by Column (Ascending)","text":""},{"location":"Machine%20Learning/Sorting%20Data/#by-column-descending","title":"by Column (Descending)","text":""},{"location":"Pandas/Read%20File/","title":"Read File","text":""},{"location":"Pandas/Read%20File/#read-csv","title":"Read CSV","text":"<pre><code>pd = pd.read_csv(\"file.csv\")\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"Pandas/Read%20File/#read-excel","title":"Read Excel","text":"<pre><code>df = pd.read_excel('file.xlsx')\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"Pandas/Viewing%20Data/","title":"Viewing Data","text":""},{"location":"Pandas/Viewing%20Data/#head","title":"Head","text":"<pre><code>df.head()\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"Pandas/Viewing%20Data/#tail","title":"Tail","text":"<pre><code>df.tail()\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"Pandas/Viewing%20Data/#info-data","title":"Info Data","text":"<pre><code>df.info()\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"Pandas/Viewing%20Data/#nan-per-column","title":"NaN per Column","text":"<pre><code>df.isna().sum()\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"Pandas/Viewing%20Data/#jumlah-row-duplicated","title":"Jumlah Row Duplicated","text":"<pre><code>df[df.duplicated(keep=False)]\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"Pandas/Viewing%20Data/#row-row-yang-duplicated","title":"Row-row yang Duplicated","text":"<pre><code>df[df.duplicated(keep=False)].sort_values(by=df.columns.tolist())\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"Python/Library%20Setup/","title":"Library Setup","text":""},{"location":"Python/Library%20Setup/#installing-library","title":"Installing Library","text":"<pre><code>pip install pandas\npip install numpy\npip install matplotlib\npip install seaborn\npip install opencv-python\npip install streamlit\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"Python/Library%20Setup/#importing-library","title":"Importing Library","text":"<pre><code>import pandas as pd\nimport numpy as np\nimport matplotlib.pyplot as plt\nimport seaborn as sns\nimport math\nimport statistics\nimport cv2 as cv\nimport re\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"Python/Virtual%20Env/","title":"Virtual Env","text":""},{"location":"Python/Virtual%20Env/#create-virtual-env","title":"Create Virtual Env","text":"<p>Jalankan pada terminal untuk membuat virtual environment</p> <pre><code>python -m venv venv\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"Python/Virtual%20Env/#activate-virtual-env","title":"Activate Virtual Env","text":"<p>Jalankan pada terminal untuk mengaktifkan virtual environment</p> <pre><code>source venv/Scripts/activate\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"Python/Virtual%20Env/#requirementtxt","title":"requirement.txt","text":"<p>Jalankan pada terminal untuk melakukan installation terhadap <code>requirement.txt</code></p> <pre><code>pip install -r requirements.txt\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"Python/Virtual%20Env/#deactivate-virtual-env","title":"Deactivate Virtual Env","text":"<p>Jalankan pada terminal untuk menonaktifkan virtual environment</p> <pre><code>deactivate\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"Python/Virtual%20Env/#selecting-interpreter","title":"Selecting Interpreter","text":"<p>Setelah melakukan instalasi untuk virtual env, harus memilih interpreter dari venv agar seluruh kode berjalan dengan lancar</p> <p></p>"},{"location":"Selenium/New%20Project/","title":"New Project","text":""},{"location":"Selenium/New%20Project/#start-the-session","title":"Start the Session","text":"<pre><code>driver = webdriver.Chrome()\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"Selenium/New%20Project/#take-action-to-browser","title":"Take Action To Browser","text":"<pre><code>driver.get(\"https://www.selenium.dev/selenium/web/web-form.html\")\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"Selenium/New%20Project/#request-browser-information","title":"Request Browser Information","text":"<pre><code>title = driver.title\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"Selenium/New%20Project/#waiting-strategy","title":"Waiting Strategy","text":"<pre><code>driver.implicitly_wait(0.5)\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"Selenium/New%20Project/#find-and-element","title":"Find and Element","text":"<pre><code>text_box = driver.find_element(by=By.NAME, value=\"my-text\")\nsubmit_button = driver.find_element(by=By.CSS_SELECTOR, value=\"button\")\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"Selenium/New%20Project/#take-action-on-element","title":"Take Action On Element","text":"<pre><code>text_box.send_keys(\"Selenium\")\nsubmit_button.click()\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"Selenium/New%20Project/#request-element-information","title":"Request Element Information","text":"<pre><code>message = driver.find_element(by=By.ID, value=\"message\")\ntext = message.text\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"Selenium/New%20Project/#end-the-session","title":"End The Session","text":"<pre><code>driver.quit()\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"Selenium/New%20Project/#running-selenium-file","title":"Running Selenium File","text":"<pre><code>pytest path/to/test_script.py\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"Selenium/Selenium%20Installation/","title":"Selenium Installation","text":"<pre><code>pip install selenium\n</code></pre>"}]}